<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Эмир — 15 лет</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0b0b0b;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Стартовый экран */
        #welcome-screen {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: #000;
            z-index: 999;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            transition: opacity 0.6s ease, visibility 0.6s ease;
        }

        #welcome-screen.hidden {
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .welcome-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            opacity: 0.45;
            filter: brightness(0.6);
        }

        .enter-btn {
            position: relative;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 16px 48px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 40px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .enter-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            transform: scale(1.05);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        }

        /* Основной сайт */
        #main-site {
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.8s ease;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        #main-site.visible {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* Верхняя панель иконок */
        .top-nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 0 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .nav-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            color: #777;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.2s;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .nav-item.active {
            color: #fff;
        }

        .nav-item svg {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        .nav-label {
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Заголовок ника */
        .site-logo {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        /* Блок профиля */
        .profile-card {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .avatar-container {
            width: 75px;
            height: 75px;
            border: 2px solid #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: #222;
        }

        .avatar-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .profile-info h1 {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .profile-info p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #888;
        }

        /* Информационные строки */
        .info-section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .bio-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #ccc;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 14px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .info-label {
            color: #777;
        }

        .info-value {
            color: #fff;
            text-align: right;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }

        .info-value:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Стартовый экран -->
    <div id="welcome-screen">
        <video class="welcome-bg" autoplay muted loop playsinline>
            <source src="bg.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        <button class="enter-btn" onclick="enterSite()">Войти</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Основной сайт -->
    <div id="main-site">
        <div class="top-nav">
            <div class="nav-item active">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/></svg>
                <span class="nav-label">Профиль</span>
            </div>
            <a href="https://t.me/borzGreat" target="_blank" class="nav-item">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-2.5 11.5c-.3.2-2.1 1.2-3.1 1.7-.3.1-.6-.1-.7-.4-.3-.7-1.1-2.4-1.4-2.9l-.6-.8c-.1-.1-.3-.2-.4-.2-.1 0-.3.1-.3.2l-.7 1.8c-.2.4-.6.7-1 .8-.5.2-1.2.5-2.2 1.3-.9.7-1.5 1.2-1.7 1.4-.2.2-.2.5 0 .7.2.2.5.2.7.2 1 0 2.2-.5 3.3-1.1 1.1-.6 2.3-1.4 3.2-2.1.2-.2.5-.2.7 0 .2.2.5.4.8.7.3.3.6.6.8.8.2.2.5.2.7 0 .2-.2.5-.5.7-.8.2-.3.4-.6.6-.9.2-.3.2-.6 0-.8z"/></svg>
                <span class="nav-label">Telegram</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@great.warior" target="_blank" class="nav-item">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 0 1-5.2 1.74 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.31-4.64 2.93 2.93 0 0 1 .88.13V9.4a6.84 6.84 0 0 0-1-.05A6.33 6.33 0 0 0 5 20.1a6.34 6.34 0 0 0 10.86-4.43v-7a8.16 8.16 0 0 0 4.77 1.52v-3.4a4.85 4.85 0 0 1-1.04-.1z"/></svg>
                <span class="nav-label">TikTok</span>
            </a>
            <div class="nav-item">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z"/></svg>
                <span class="nav-label">Инфо</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="site-logo">EMIR</div>

        <div class="profile-card">
            <div class="avatar-container">
                <img src="avatar.jpg" alt="Эмир" onerror="this.src='data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\' width=\'75\' height=\'75\' fill=\'%23555\'><rect width=\'75\' height=\'75\'/></svg>'">
            </div>
            <div class="profile-info">
                <h1>Эмир, 15 лет</h1>
                <p>Подробнее — ниже.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-section">
            <div class="bio-text">
                Добро пожаловать на мой мини-сайт. Занимаюсь перепродажей аккаунтов.
            </div>

            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Занятия</span>
                <span class="info-value">Перепродажа аккаунтов</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Telegram</span>
                <a href="https://t.me/borzGreat" target="_blank" class="info-value">@borzGreat</a>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">TikTok</span>
                <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@great.warior" target="_blank" class="info-value">@great.warior</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function enterSite() {
            const welcome = document.getElementById('welcome-screen');
            const main = document.getElementById('main-site');
            
            welcome.classList.add('hidden');
            main.classList.add('visible');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
